OL,3,GNEWSADoormen stepped in to stop broken
OL,4,Abottle attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have praised the actions of
OL,7,Fsecurity staff from a Leeds pub after
OL,8,Fthey stepped in to help a woman who was
OL,9,Fbeing attacked by a man armed with a
OL,10,Fbroken bottle.
OL,12,FThe victim was on her way home from a
OL,13,Fmeal out in March 2024 when Ibrahim
OL,14,FAlbashir grabbed her and launched a
OL,15,F"frenzied" attack.
OL,17,FLeeds Crown Court heard the men
OL,18,Fresponded to the assault opposite the
OL,19,FOriginal Oak pub, in Otley Road, after
OL,20,Fhearing her "blood-curdling screams",
OL,21,Fknocking Albashir, 34, unconscious in
OL,22,Forder to stop him.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
