OL,3,GNEWSADoormen stepped in to stop broken
OL,4,Abottle attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlbashir, who is originally from Sudan
OL,7,Fand has catatonic schizophrenia, was
OL,8,Fgiven a 25-year prison sentence along
OL,9,Fwith an indefinite hospital order after
OL,10,Fadmitting attempted murder at an
OL,11,Fearlier hearing.
